  message: "Fixed in PR #3597 (commit e7bac33ee5). Acceptance path (B) per the WI-milak tracker spec: kind-segregated multi-value index populated by RustAnalyzer.register_symbol, consulted by impl_item lookup with trait > struct/enum kind preference. Same-file tie-break + stable-id deterministic fallback. WI-kahaz behavior preserved (no fall-through to non-trait). 3 new regression tests cover trait-first / struct-first / same-file orderings; full smart-test green (3048 tests). Path (A) — populate meta.base_classes and defer to linkers/inheritance.py — and path (C) — kind-segregated multi-value global_symbols mirroring go.py:3998 — remain follow-up work. Empirical re-confirmation on candle is gated on BUG-06 path (a) shipping (so a SCIP comparator is available); no candle bakeoff was run as part of this PR."  # 5fa2
