  message: "Validated via UAT round-01 of hg-uat-v5.0.1 (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/bakeoff_artifacts/hg-uat-v5.0.1/lab-notebook/round-01-candle/). Verdict: moved. Mechanism: matches.\n\n15/15 sampled 'impl Module for X' blocks resolve to rust:candle-core/src/lib.rs:148-150:Module:trait rather than the same-named candle-kernels Module struct. Forward probe (kind-segregated trait preference) confirmed on the two trait/struct collisions present in candle (Module, SchedulerConfig). The kind-segregated multi-value index from PR #3597 produces the documented trait>struct/enum preference end-to-end. See master-report §3.1."  # 6579
